    <briefdescription>
<para>The optimization diagnostic interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It allows reporting when optimizations are performed and when they are not along with the reasons for it. Hotness information of the corresponding code region can be included in the remark if DiagnosticsHotnessRequested is enabled in the LLVM context. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
